    <briefdescription>
<para>Add a dependency to the dependency graph. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This score state doesn&apos;t do anything other than add edges to the dependency graph. This can be useful when involved filters are used as they are not included in the dependency graph. This may go away and be replaced by adding dependencies to the <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1SubsetFilterTable" kindref="compound">SubsetFilterTable</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
